  "published": "2026-07-09T03:10:08.233Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "• Added automatic ViewModel convention binding from UseShellInject()\n            • Kept ViewModelType XAML binding as an explicit override with precedence over convention binding\n            • Added configurable ShellInjectOptions for convention binding behavior\n            • Hardened modal, modal-stack, multi-stack, tab, and reverse-data navigation flows\n            • Preserved obsolete Shell extension methods for non-breaking compatibility while forwarding to ShellNavigation\n            • Added source/symbol package support, package validation, deterministic build settings, and CI package validation\n            • Updated NuGet dependencies to the latest available versions for this release\n            • Expanded unit coverage for convention binding, navigation edge cases, and compatibility behavior\n            • Reworked README documentation with setup, usage, compatibility, and trimming guidance",
